    {
      "text": "many shall come … and shall sit down with Abraham, Matt. 8:11 (Luke 13:29). ye also shall sit upon twelve thrones, Matt. 19:28 (Luke 22:30). Grant that these my two sons may sit, Matt. 20:21 (Mark 10:37). shall he sit upon the throne of his glory, Matt. 25:31. sitting on the right hand of power, Matt. 26:64 (Mark 14:62; Luke 22:69). angel … rolled back the stone … and sat upon it, Matt. 28:2. colt tied, whereon never man sat, Mark 11:2 (Luke 19:30). Lord … sat on the right hand of God, Mark 16:19 (Heb. 10:12; Moro. 7:27). found him … sitting in the midst of the doctors, Luke 2:46. Jesus … sat thus on the well, John 4:6. made us sit together in heavenly places, Eph. 2:6. Christ sitteth on the right hand of God, Col. 3:1. he as God sitteth in the temple of God, 2 Thes. 2:4. he … sat down on the right hand of the Majesty, Heb. 1:3. Sit thou here in a good place, James 2:3. will I grant to sit with me, Rev. 3:21. great whore that sitteth upon many waters, Rev. 17:1 (1 Ne. 14:11; D&C 88:94).",
